{"id":"en_the-love-that-made-him-disappear","title":"The Love That Made Him Disappear","titleEn":"The Love That Made Him Disappear","description":"A shattered man is offered a rare opportunity by the person he will one day become. Waking again at the age of ten, he devotes himself to constructing a business empire while rescuing a woman he is unable to love without gradually vanishing. He chooses to release her. In the decisive final clash, he discards the knife and places his faith in the law instead. Time then sets him free. The question remains whether a man who once erased his own existence can at last remain and embrace love.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-love-that-made-him-disappear/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-love-that-made-him-disappear/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Rebirth","Urban Life","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddka2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-love-that-made-him-disappear_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddka2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-love-that-made-him-disappear_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddka2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-love-that-made-him-disappear_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ddka2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-love-that-made-him-disappear_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumbl